<div class="grid three"><div class="card pink"><h3>主题创作</h3><p><a class="link" href="https://cherrycss.com">Theme Gallery</a><br><a class="link" href="https://github.com/hakadao/CherryStudio-Aero">Aero</a><br><a class="link" href="https://github.com/rainoffallingstar/CherryStudio-PaperMaterial">PaperMaterial</a><br><a class="link" href="https://github.com/bjl101501/CherryStudio-Claudestyle-dynamic">Claude dynamic-style</a><br><a class="link" href="https://github.com/BoningtonChen/CherryStudio_themes">Maple Neon</a></p><p class="small muted">README 欢迎提交更多主题 PR。</p></div><div class="card"><h3>README 关联项目</h3><p><a class="link" href="https://github.com/QuantumNous/new-api">new-api</a> · LLM 网关与资产管理<br><a class="link" href="https://github.com/songquanpeng/one-api">one-api</a> · API 管理与分发<br><a class="link" href="https://poe.com/">Poe</a> · AI 服务平台<br><a class="link" href="https://github.com/iorate/ublacklist">ublacklist</a> · 搜索站点屏蔽</p><p class="small muted">此处为关联项目清单，不代表均已集成为功能。</p></div><div class="card"><h3>社区连接</h3><p><a class="link" href="https://t.me/CherryStudioAI">Telegram</a><br><a class="link" href="https://discord.gg/wez8HtpxqQ">Discord</a><br><a class="link" href="https://qm.qq.com/q/lo0D4qVZKi">QQ群 575014769</a><br><a class="link" href="https://github.com/CherryHQ/cherry-studio/discussions">GitHub Discussions</a></p><p class="small muted">参与讨论、帮助用户、分享使用经验。</p></div></div>
